flowchart LR
  accTitle: From a reusable DOT to a verified deployment
  accDescr: DOT-Domain generates the schemas. The catalogue stores reusable DOT definitions. A composition selects exact DOT releases and connects their Anchors. dotx validates the declarations and operates selected deployments. Live API checks are separate evidence, not a consequence of valid declarations.

  Domain["DOT-Domain<br/>model + schemas"]
  Catalogue["Catalogue<br/>reusable DOTs"]
  Dot["DOT definition"]
  Composition["Composition<br/>DOTs + wires"]
  CLI["dotx<br/>validate + operate"]
  Runtime["Chosen runtime<br/>one deployment"]
  Evidence["Live checks<br/>real API responses"]

  Catalogue -->|stores| Dot
  Domain -.->|schema| Dot
  Domain -.->|schema| Composition
  Dot -->|select releases| Composition
  Dot --> CLI
  Composition --> CLI
  CLI -->|deploy one| Runtime
  Runtime -->|verify separately| Evidence

